--- /dev/null
+++ b/KIO-FORK.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# KIO Photo
+
+Independent KIO branding fork of [PhotoCraft v0.9.0](https://github.com/storytold/photocraft/tree/c699e3cda69f4852b43c0b191ab0091aaeff9d6a), originally by the ArtCraft team and contributors. KIO branding is not endorsed by ArtCraft.
+
+Original engine, codecs, formats and features are retained. Original LICENSE, NOTICE, contributor credits and asset attribution remain applicable and are preserved. KIO icon is the existing user-supplied KIO artwork; no ArtCraft trademark logo is included.
+
+Inherited limitations: Upstream explicitly says it is not yet a Photoshop replacement for daily professional work. AI/generative, tool depth, typography and plugin gaps remain.
+
+This patch has not been compiled or functionally verified. Do not describe it as a completed native release until the platform build, profile separation and file round-trip checks pass.
